Z||000000||Gokart||07-06-2000||08:59 PM||||Would someone mind showing/taking a picture of the battery in tray with that plastic wall that is on the left. I never had this plastic wall and found one at the boneyard but have NO IDEA how it goes in place. I keep flipping it around trying to match shape/holes but to no avail. TIA <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR> Marc                     87GT||||reg||5
